{"availability":"available","full":"jonathanperis/speedy-bird-lynx","name":"speedy-bird-lynx","description":"Flappy Bird-inspired arcade game built with ReactLynx and TypeScript. Android host, Lynx web preview, playable Canvas demo, and Astro docs; iOS source scaffold included. Every pipe makes it faster.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-01T17:57:56Z","updated":"2026-10-16T19:23:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jonathanperis.github.io/speedy-bird-lynx/","topics":["android","arcade-game","astro","bytedance","canvas","cross-platform","flappy-bird","game","github-pages","ios","lynx","native-ui","pixel-art","reactlynx","rspeedy","typescript"],"demo":"https://jonathanperis.github.io/speedy-bird-lynx/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.822Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.822Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.822Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:55.975Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:46.194Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:25.115Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.822Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Flappy Bird clone built with ReactLynx and TypeScript — runs on Android, iOS, and the Web from a single codebase","Lynx is an open-source cross-platform native UI framework created by ByteDance. It uses a native rendering engine rather than a WebView on mobile. Speedy Bird runs its frame loop, taps, and simulation on the Lynx main thread with Main Thread Script, and uses React on the background thread only for discrete UI such as the score and overlays. It demonstrates element-based rendering, frame-rate-independent physics, native modules, assets, and automated builds. The public website plays the same ReactLynx build in the browser through Lynx's web runtime."],"features":["Tap/click to flap; in browsers, Space/Enter also flap while the game has focus","Speed increases 1% per pipe cleared; points score the moment the bird clears a pipe","Frame-rate-independent physics (fixed 1/60 s steps) on a main-thread frame loop","Scales to any screen: extra height becomes sky, wide screens are letterboxed","Best score saved by the host; restart is locked briefly after a crash so the results stay visible"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jonathanperis/speedy-bird-lynx/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e598e8048191e80ca4852649c90925e9bd898404c2080c5f09bc6b45d70874fe","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.149Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.930Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Flappy Bird clone built with ReactLynx and TypeScript — runs on Android, iOS, and the Web from a single codebase","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jonathanperis/speedy-bird-lynx/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e598e8048191e80ca4852649c90925e9bd898404c2080c5f09bc6b45d70874fe","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jonathanperis/speedy-bird-lynx/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.931Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T19:23:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jonathanperis/speedy-bird-lynx/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.931Z","hash":"e598e8048191e80ca4852649c90925e9bd898404c2080c5f09bc6b45d70874fe","originalBytes":11522,"storedBytes":11522,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:07.822Z","subjects":["Games & game development","Android","Apple","Mobile"],"platforms":["Android","iOS & iPadOS"],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Games & game development","Android","Apple","Mobile"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Games & game development","source":"metadata","match":"game"},{"subject":"Android","source":"metadata","match":"Android"},{"subject":"Apple","source":"metadata","match":"iOS"},{"subject":"Mobile","source":"metadata","match":"Andro